flowchart LR
  accTitle: Design Studio marketing visitor paths
  accDescr: A visitor reads the introduction in human or agent mode, explores captured examples, and uses the repository and terminal commands to run a studio. The setup guide helps with configuration.
  A[Choose human or agent mode] --> B[Understand Design Studio]
  B --> C[Explore captured examples]
  C --> D[Clone and run the studio]
  B --> D
  D --> E[Configure with the setup guide]
